  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>∵</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are coplanar, hence,&nbsp;<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Now point of intersection will be <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Equation of required plane is&nbsp;<math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math>",
